  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e08-scene-05",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "方案会提前两天  (Moving the Pitch Meeting Forward)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "qin_xiao": "秦箫"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Over at the network liaison office, assistant Qin Xiao nudges her director to move the Twelve Singers pitch review two days earlier while Chun Yuqiao is still in hospital. Listen to Qin Xiao in Mandarin first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "主任，还有四天就到方案会了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "咱们能给星天宽限时间，可是台里不会给我们宽限。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "难不成咱们私下里找他？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "这星天总编室明明就多了一个人，怎么做事情还没有以前快了呢？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "现在公司上下没人敢过问这事。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "不过我还是挺担心台里的日程呢。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "其实我有一个主意，要不您听听？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "我们把方案会提前两天。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "这样就算星天出了什么纰漏，我们也有时间去修改。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "也不会耽误台里领导看方案啊。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "那我去通知他们。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "主任，还有四天就到方案会了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Director, the proposal meeting is only four days away.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "咱们能给星天宽限时间，可是台里不会给我们宽限。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'We can grant Xingtian extra time, yet the network will not grant us an extension.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "难不成咱们私下里找他？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Should we perhaps reach out to him privately?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "这星天总编室明明就多了一个人，怎么做事情还没有以前快了呢？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Xingtian's editorial office clearly added a person—why are they moving slower than before?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "现在公司上下没人敢过问这事。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Right now nobody across the company dares question it.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "不过我还是挺担心台里的日程呢。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Still, I am quite worried about the network's schedule.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "其实我有一个主意，要不您听听？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Actually I have an idea—would you like to hear it?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "我们把方案会提前两天。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Let us move the proposal meeting forward by two days.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "这样就算星天出了什么纰漏，我们也有时间去修改。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'That way, even if Xingtian slips up, we still have time to revise.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "也不会耽误台里领导看方案啊。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'And it will not delay the network leadership from reviewing the plan.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "那我去通知他们。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Then I will go notify them right away.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "主任，还有四天就到方案会了。",
      "gap": 0.5
